      "versionNonce": 3042, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1731000000200,
      "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "MainWindowViewModel（复用现有）\nCommunityToolkit.Mvvm 8.4.2 ｜ 源生成器 [ObservableProperty] / [RelayCommand]（零反射）\n\n被绑定成员：\nGroupedSessions · SearchText · SelectedSession · Messages · Composer\nIsDeepThinkEnabled · IsWebSearchEnabled · ShowSend / ShowStop\nNewSessionCommand · SendCommand（另 StopCommand / RegenerateCommand）",
      "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 19, "containerId": null, "originalText": "MainWindowViewModel（复用现有）\nCommunityToolkit.Mvvm 8.4.2 ｜ 源生成器 [ObservableProperty] / [RelayCommand]（零反射）\n\n被绑定成员：\nGroupedSessions · SearchText · SelectedSession · Messages · Composer\nIsDeepThinkEnabled · IsWebSearchEnabled · ShowSend / ShowStop\nNewSessionCommand · SendCommand（另 StopCommand / RegenerateCommand）", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25 },
